{
  "id": "variable_frequency_drives___heat_loss_and_required",
  "title": "Variable Frequency Drives - Heat Loss and Required Air Cooling",
  "description": "Calculate heat loss from variable frequency drives and determine the required air cooling (mass flow and volume flow) needed to maintain safe operating temperatures.",
  "type": "chart-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Variable Frequency Drive Heat Loss and Air Cooling Calculator\n\nThis tool calculates:\n1. **Heat Loss**: The power lost as heat in a VFD based on transmitted power and efficiency\n2. **Mass Air Flow**: Required mass flow of cooling air needed\n3. **Volume Air Flow**: Required volume flow of cooling air at inlet and outlet temperatures\n\n### Key Formulas:\n- Heat Loss (kW): Hloss = Pt × (1 - ηd)\n- Heat Loss (BTU/h): Hloss = Pt × 3412 × (1 - ηd)\n- Mass Air Flow: mair = Hloss / (cp × (tout - tin))\n- Volume Air Flow: qair = (1 / ρair) × Hloss / (cp × (tout - tin))"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "power_transmitted",
          "label": "Power Transmitted Through VFD",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 50,
          "unit": "kW"
        },
        {
          "id": "vfd_efficiency",
          "label": "VFD Efficiency",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.95,
          "unit": "decimal (0-1)"
        },
        {
          "id": "inlet_temp",
          "label": "Inlet Air Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 20,
          "unit": "°C"
        },
        {
          "id": "outlet_temp",
          "label": "Outlet Air Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 40,
          "unit": "°C"
        },
        {
          "id": "inlet_air_density",
          "label": "Inlet Air Density",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1.205,
          "unit": "kg/m³"
        },
        {
          "id": "outlet_air_density",
          "label": "Outlet Air Density",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1.127,
          "unit": "kg/m³"
        },
        {
          "id": "specific_heat_air",
          "label": "Specific Heat of Air",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1.005,
          "unit": "kJ/kg·°C"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "heat_loss_kw",
          "label": "Heat Loss",
          "formula": "inputs.power_transmitted * (1 - inputs.vfd_efficiency)",
          "unit": "kW",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "heat_loss_btu",
          "label": "Heat Loss (Imperial)",
          "formula": "inputs.power_transmitted * 3412 * (1 - inputs.vfd_efficiency)",
          "unit": "BTU/h",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "mass_air_flow",
          "label": "Required Mass Air Flow",
          "formula": "(inputs.power_transmitted * (1 - inputs.vfd_efficiency) * 1000) / (inputs.specific_heat_air * (inputs.outlet_temp - inputs.inlet_temp))",
          "unit": "kg/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "volume_air_flow_inlet",
          "label": "Volume Air Flow at Inlet",
          "formula": "((inputs.power_transmitted * (1 - inputs.vfd_efficiency) * 1000) / (inputs.specific_heat_air * (inputs.outlet_temp - inputs.inlet_temp))) / inputs.inlet_air_density",
          "unit": "m³/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "volume_air_flow_inlet_hourly",
          "label": "Volume Air Flow at Inlet (Hourly)",
          "formula": "(((inputs.power_transmitted * (1 - inputs.vfd_efficiency) * 1000) / (inputs.specific_heat_air * (inputs.outlet_temp - inputs.inlet_temp))) / inputs.inlet_air_density) * 3600",
          "unit": "m³/h",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "volume_air_flow_outlet",
          "label": "Volume Air Flow at Outlet",
          "formula": "((inputs.power_transmitted * (1 - inputs.vfd_efficiency) * 1000) / (inputs.specific_heat_air * (inputs.outlet_temp - inputs.inlet_temp))) / inputs.outlet_air_density",
          "unit": "m³/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "volume_air_flow_outlet_hourly",
          "label": "Volume Air Flow at Outlet (Hourly)",
          "formula": "(((inputs.power_transmitted * (1 - inputs.vfd_efficiency) * 1000) / (inputs.specific_heat_air * (inputs.outlet_temp - inputs.inlet_temp))) / inputs.outlet_air_density) * 3600",
          "unit": "m³/h",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
